@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #2B6CB0
  RoundCorner 12
}
rectangle "**SCOPE**\nwhat is built" as U
rectangle "**TIME**\nwhen it is finished" as Z
rectangle "**RESOURCES**\npeople, money, equipment" as R
U -down- Z
U -down- R
Z -right- R
note as Q
  Quality is not a fourth corner –
  it is silently sacrificed
  when all three corners are fixed.
end note
Z -[hidden]down- Q
@enduml
